{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_07_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "10ccc4b72dc6229d7295189617d2373de4c38fe191737634fbc37a834f24d000", "ja": "彼女の言葉は、人も機械も狂わせる……。", "zh": "她的言语，会让人类和机器都陷入疯狂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
